    {
      "en": "scene christmashome1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome1.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, good! You’re home.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was starting to think you secretly hated me and were just never coming back.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You think that every time I get up to go to the bathroom.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welcome home, Sensei! I tried to put up mistletoe so we could kiss and no one would be allowed to get mad, but Ami took it down.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome2.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You taped it to your forehead! Of course I took it down!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s wrong with you?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Me? What do you mean?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You look...bad.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank you, Maya. You really have a way with words sometimes.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know what I mean.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Do I really seem so off that even Maya is able to pick up on it?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I figured the walk home would be more than enough to clear my head, but...I guess not.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe it’s just the weather again?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That’s sure as hell a better scapegoat than the probability of me molesting a girl only to be immediately forgiven by her and then...given a gift?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s weird to say this, but I kind of wish Molly was a little more torn up about this than she is.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "At least that would justify all of the...feelings I’ve had since Halloween.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Feelings are annoying. And I’m annoyed that they haven’t started hiding again yet.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m fine. What are all of you up to? I’m not really sure what a pre-Christmas party Christmas party consists of.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome3.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just watching movies and eating a bunch of cakes Ayane brought over. There’s some left on the counter if you want any.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No thanks. I’m probably just going to go to sleep early tonight.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome4.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?! No! Why?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you so excited for the real party that you don’t want the pre-party to spoil it?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...didn’t think you were looking forward to it that much, Sensei...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome5.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh! Um...before I forget...my mom wanted me to ask if...you could come help decorate the bar tomorrow morning...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why? So she can have something to stare at when the place is inevitably dead all night?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Brutal.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They’re...having a Christmas party...and she actually expects it to be busy...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well good for her for never giving up hope.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now, if you’ll please excuse me-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome6.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No! You really can’t leave yet! Not until Niki shows up!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, Niki is coming? Why?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome7.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...no. But she’s performing a new Christmas song for a variety show tonight and you have to be here for it!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I don’t even really like Niki’s music. It’s too...pink.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome8.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t care how much I love you. In this house, we treat Niki Nakayama with respect.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Especially now that I’ve been accepted as her honorary little sister.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, wonderful. Does this mean she’s gotten rid of her other one? Because that would confirm once and for all that Christmas miracles are real.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome9.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...right. Sorry, Maya. I know you get all grumpy whenever anything even remotely related to Noriko comes up.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t get grumpy. I get murderous.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not giving my hatred enough credit.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My mistake...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think Niki’s going on soon, Sensei. So if you really are tired and aren’t just trying to get away from a bunch of people who love you very much, you won’t have to wait around for long.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, if you just happen to find the mistletoe that I hid in the medicine cabinet we can kill a few minutes by kissing in front of everyone!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...feel the need to...tell you that I don’t love-",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hi, everyone! Thank you all so much for coming out to see me on this very special holiday!",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome10.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah! My queen! She speaks!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Everyone shut up and gather around the TV!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just as Ami asks, everyone directs their attention to the front of the room, but none do so as enthusiastically as she does.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I think it’s a little weird how obsessed with my ex-girlfriend my [niece] is, but it’s not like she actively chose to be obsessed with her for that reason.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And it’s not like I can expect her to stop now that-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei! Stop thinking! Niki is talking!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome11.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How could you hear me thinking?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow...she...really does look like Noriko...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, right! You listen to like...metal and stuff. Right, Sana?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...I don’t know if...I’ve ever heard Niki’s music before.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure you’ll love it. She’s super talented and super pretty and super nice and-",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure you don’t want to get a little closer, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No thanks. I’ve seen Niki up close plenty of times.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, no. I meant to me.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No one’s paying attention.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m still here...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay. No one except Maya is paying attention. And she definitely doesn’t like you, so she won’t care at all.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And super funny and super awesome and-",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Before I start singing...I just want you all to know that...you’re the reason I can do this.",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re what gives me the courage I never had when I was younger! And I think that you should have courage too!",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So please, enjoy this new song!",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even if you’re one of those people who sometimes has a hard time enjoying anything.",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It might come as a little bit of a surprise, but I used to be one of those people.",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re never alone! Because you’ll always have me!",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I’m never alone because I’ll always have you!",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Miracles are real!",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please enjoy! Tokimeki Labyrinth!",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahhhhhhhhhhhhh! Niki!! I love you!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Meanwhile...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome12.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noriko, I know you’ve probably heard this enough by now, but I really want your sister to just fucking go to town on me.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is this just what you’re going to do from now on? Just constantly tell me about all of the people you want to fuck you?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, don’t blame me for everyone else being like, crazy attractive and shit.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want you to fuck me too, but it’s not like I’m going to beg or anything.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": God! Fuck! Why does Nee-chan have to be so fucking perfect?! How do I compete with that?!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome13.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What if Sensei’s watching this right now?! What if he’s falling in love again as we speak?!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If Sensei is watching this, it’s probably safe to assume he’s either: A) masturbating. Or B) fingering one of our classmates.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thinking about it is just going to drive you crazy.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How will hearing those options help?!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome14.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, why are you yelling at me?! I just wanted to watch your hot sister sing a Christmas song and now it’s suddenly counseling hour.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ugh, I don’t know. I’m just really nervous about tomorrow.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome15.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why? You’re not even coming.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not completely ditching the party. Didn’t I tell you I still planned on dropping by to give Sensei his present?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably, but it’s such a boring present that I must have just forgotten that conversation ever happened.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome16.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not boring! It has a load of sentimental value and the potential to change our relationship forever!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, yeah, whatever. If I were you, I’d just give him a handjob. He’d probably like that more.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene christmashome12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/christmashome12.webp",
      "alt": "christmashome12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ugh. You’re such a fucking horny bitch.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aww, thank you. That’s so sweet.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": FUCK! WHY IS SHE SO PERFECT?!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
